Test Case Type:
Aggregator On-Us Conversion Reconciliation

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that Aggregator On-Us Conversion includes all applications that progressed to a final accepted application outcome, irrespective of whether the interim On-Us decision was Accept, Refer or Decline.

Expected Results:
Aggregator On-Us Conversion should equal the sum of:
API On-Us Accept → Application Accept
+ API On-Us Refer → Application Accept
+ API On-Us Decline → Application Accept.

The calculated conversion volume should reconcile with zero difference for each application decision date.

